<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WOMEN'S JAVELIN TO BE MODIFIED.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WOMEN'S JAVELIN TO BE MODIFIED.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The centre of gravity of the women's javelin will be lowered by three centimetres from the next world championships in 1999 in Seville, Spain.</p>
<p>International Amateur Athletic Federation general secretary Istvan Gyulai said on Sunday the change would help ensure the javelin landed on its tip and not flat.</p>
</text>
